{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おづじゃ〜〜ん！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobDH43q1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！\n小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー2026"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ始まりました！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうですか皆さん？\n盛り上がっていますか？？？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はとっても楽しんでおります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは福井公演が終わりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめまして福井！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださった皆さん\n心の中で応援してくださった皆さん\n支えてくださったスタッフの皆さん\nありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お客さんとの距離が想像以上に近く\nたくさんの方と目を合わせることや\n奥の方までペンライトやタオルを\n見ることができて\nとても嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪型も2日間で変えたの！\nわかりにくいかもしれないけど\n編み込みとゆる巻きハーフアップです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobztKkdk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobbaaJ2o.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも\n色々な髪型に挑戦するガオ〜🦖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "福井は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝倉氏の城下町であった\n一乗谷や"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "織田信長の家臣であった\n柴田勝家の城があり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "織田信長の妹であり柴田勝家の妻の\nお市の方も住んでいたという歴史があります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "歴史好き&旅行好きの私としては\n福井を訪れることができて\nとってもとっても興奮しておりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今度は福井城も訪れたいな🏯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして\nはじめまして恐竜🦕🦖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/moby8p8ru.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "福井が恐竜王国と呼ばれる理由は、\n日本で発掘される恐竜の骨の\nなんと約8割が福井から発掘されている\nからなのです🦕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜそんなに恐竜が発掘されるのか、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鯖江のメガネをかけた\nれいな教授に\n説明してもらいましょう👓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🥸ふむふむ\n私が解説しましょう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "恐竜が多く発掘される理由の一つに\nボーンベッドが多くあること\nがあげられます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ボーンベッドとは\n恐竜などの化石が一箇所に\n集まって発掘される場所のこと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この珍しいボーンベッドが\n福井では何層にもなって見つかっているため\nたくさんの恐竜化石が\n発掘されているのです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いやはや\n福井はすごい県ですなぁ\nいつか恐竜を発掘しにいきたいと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なるほど〜\nれいな教授\nありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはプライベートでも\n恐竜を発掘しにいくしかないですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ！もしかしたら\n新種の恐竜を発見できちゃうかも！？！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて名前をつけようかな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "フクイサウルスはいるから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オヅサウルス？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レイナサウルス？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夢が膨らみますね〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かにめし\n羽二重もち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しいご飯をたくさん食べることも\nできました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私にとっては初めての全国ツアー\n現在進行形で\nとってもとっても楽しいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早く全国の皆さんに\nお会いしたいです！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人類の夢が詰まった化石が\nたくさん発掘されるボーンベッドのように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブ会場が\n皆さんの夢が集まる\n幸せのボーンベッドとなりますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚫︎乃木坂工事中"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「乃木坂46因縁相撲2026・春場所 後編」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小川さんと戦わせていただきました！\n人生で初めて相撲をとったの！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "難しかったけどとっても楽しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚫︎スター誕生！SIX"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小林幸子さんと「千本桜」を\n歌わせていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小林さんと歌わせていただいた喜びと\nボカロが好きなのでボカロを歌えた喜びで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても楽しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "難しい曲でしたが\n挑戦することができて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひHuluでもご覧ください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚫︎乃木の「の」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月22日の乃木の「の」に\n初めて登場させていただきます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "菅原さんとたくさんお話しさせて\nいただきました\nぜひお聴きください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも\nよろしくお願いします！"}], "source": "official"}